{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892710/extras/9116143885efa1cd22d45f2a4dd7e233.poster.avif?t=1759763783\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892710/extras/9116143885efa1cd22d45f2a4dd7e233.webm?t=1759763783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892710/extras/9116143885efa1cd22d45f2a4dd7e233.mp4?t=1759763783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Start from scratch</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers ready-made furniture, plants, and countless other decorative elements. Moreover, with customizable 3D shapes you can bring to life even the most unusual ideas. Arrange the rooms as you wish \u2014 design mode gives you endless customization possibilities! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use customizable 3D shapes to create unique home decor items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange plants from the in-game collection or generate them yourself</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint the walls or lay the tiles piece by piece </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the desired atmosphere with lighting \u2014 hang string lights or place bulbs for ambiance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Renovate the house in first person or in free camera mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm yourself with powerful tools and embark on your dream renovation! You alone decide how the space around you should look!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892710/extras/835a161f6b47e7960bbf52b382b1afdb.poster.avif?t=1759763783\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892710/extras/835a161f6b47e7960bbf52b382b1afdb.webm?t=1759763783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892710/extras/835a161f6b47e7960bbf52b382b1afdb.mp4?t=1759763783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bring harmony to your home</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the time of day, lightning, colors and materials. Design according to your taste! 3D objects will help you to realize even the most unusual ideas: change the room layout, play with heights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892710/extras/4636b2119696e05d1742a0c7dd4c2db4.poster.avif?t=1759763783\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892710/extras/4636b2119696e05d1742a0c7dd4c2db4.webm?t=1759763783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892710/extras/4636b2119696e05d1742a0c7dd4c2db4.mp4?t=1759763783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Finished with your house? Help others!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the editor mode, a task mode is also available in the game. Perfect for players who crave clear renovation goals. Complete client requests, earn money, and fill their homes with your ideas!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3892710?t=1759763783","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892710/a0ea7d1b36f22d6dd2dc590cd2edb94d89d64f8b/page_