lp others!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the editor mode, a task mode is also available in the game. Perfect for players who crave clear renovation goals. Complete client requests, earn money, and fill their homes with your ideas!</p>","developers":["GWG"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892710/b0c87aa105cf0476dadd4b1fb02bdd181aeaa791/header.jpg?t=1759763783","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12.0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon M1 or Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  Apple M1 GPU or Intel Iris Plus Graphics 640<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12.0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Apple Silicon M2 or Intel Core i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  Apple M2 GPU or Intel Iris Pro Graphics 5200 <br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3892710/1561318174/61389ea7128e806089c5ef1aaa854473901ae0a5/1755870153/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755871206","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3892710/1561318174/61389ea7128e806089c5ef1aaa854473901ae0a5/1755870153/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755871206","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3892710/1561318174/61389ea7128e806089c5ef1aaa854473901ae0a5/1755870153